      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……究竟什么样的话语、行动、判断，\n对现在的北港火山才是最好的。\n我一边呼吸着外头的空气，一边思索时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75f33b65a0540c10e72654b2bfa87b531bcb64aec4824e53402c9281154670",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
