      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──因为你不在训练员室，我到处去找你呢。\n一直待在外面的话，会感冒喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c0198fa00e102cdf302401a7657cb1bc918dcc093ebe87c4a22c9e3da58d40b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
