    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8578cbc33fc1110f06ee6da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……醒目飞鹰曾对我说过\n“希望你在北港火山身边\n好好关注她”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c306b609e19f38fcf928bfb613500a6f105adb7bffc85aed192b4ca26b8c793c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d958d60df5febfd3c112f3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我不仅未能察觉她藏在心里的想法，\n也不知道该对她说什么才好，\n只能呆呆站在这里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "52db461009cdc30c6dc4e42e571f53a2d3680b7d9aca3d2e565734eda99a6a20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
